# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Experiment: $T_1$ (spin-lattice relaxation) {#experiment-t_1-spin-lattice-relaxation}"
msgstr "Eksperimen: $T_1$ (relaksasi spin-kisi) {#experiment-t_1-spin-lattice-relaxation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Theory {#theory-2}"
msgstr "Teori {#theory-2}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Left alone, an excited spin gives up energy to its surroundings (the \"lattice\") and relaxes back toward thermal equilibrium. The excited-state population decays exponentially with the **spin-lattice relaxation time** $T_1$:\n"
msgstr "Kalau dibiarkan, spin yang tereksitasi akan melepaskan energi ke sekitarnya (\"kisi\") dan berelaksasi kembali ke kesetimbangan termal. Populasi keadaan tereksitasi meluruh secara eksponensial dengan **waktu relaksasi spin-kisi** $T_1$:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$$P_1(\\tau) = e^{-\\tau/T_1}.$$\n"
msgstr "$$P_1(\\tau) = e^{-\\tau/T_1}.$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For a chemist, $T_1$ sets the **recycle delay** you must wait between scans for quantitative NMR, and it reports on **molecular tumbling** and dynamics. On a qubit it is the energy-relaxation time, and is one of the two main numbers used to model the decoherence effects in a quantum computer.\n"
msgstr "Bagi seorang kimiawan, $T_1$ menentukan **jeda daur ulang** yang harus ditunggu di antara pemindaian untuk NMR kuantitatif, dan juga menggambarkan **gerak berputar molekul** serta dinamikanya. Pada qubit, ini adalah waktu relaksasi energi, dan merupakan salah satu dari dua angka utama untuk memodelkan efek dekoherensi di komputer kuantum.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**The experiment.** Prepare $|1\\rangle$ with an $X$ gate (a $\\pi$ pulse), wait a variable delay $\\tau$, then measure. The fraction still in $|1\\rangle$ traces out the decay.\n"
msgstr "**Eksperimennya.** Siapkan $|1\\rangle$ dengan gate $X$ (pulsa $\\pi$), tunggu jeda variabel $\\tau$, lalu ukur. Fraksi yang masih berada di $|1\\rangle$ menggambarkan peluruhannya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "A Bloch-sphere view {#a-bloch-sphere-view-1}"
msgstr "Tampilan bola Bloch {#a-bloch-sphere-view-1}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$T_1$ relaxation returns the excited state to equilibrium, so the Bloch vector slides from $|1\\rangle$ back up to $|0\\rangle$ along the $z$-axis.\n"
msgstr "Relaksasi $T_1$ mengembalikan keadaan tereksitasi ke kesetimbangan, sehingga vektor Bloch meluncur dari $|1\\rangle$ kembali ke $|0\\rangle$ sepanjang sumbu $z$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
