#, no-wrap
msgid "Hahn echo ($T_2$): Add a refocusing $\\pi$ pulse in the middle {#hahn-echo-t_2-add-a-refocusing-pi-pulse-in-the-middle}"
msgstr "Gema Hahn ($T_2$): Tambahkan pulsa $\\pi$ pemfokus ulang di tengah {#hahn-echo-t_2-add-a-refocusing-pi-pulse-in-the-middle}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "A Bloch-sphere view {#a-bloch-sphere-view-3}"
msgstr "Tampilan bola Bloch {#a-bloch-sphere-view-3}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The **Hahn echo**: the spins fan out as before, then a $\\pi$ pulse flips them, so their continued precession **refocuses** them back together (the red vector regrows), recovering the coherence lost to static dephasing.\n"
msgstr "**Gema Hahn**: spin menyebar seperti sebelumnya, lalu pulsa $\\pi$ membalikkannya, sehingga presesi lanjutan mereka **memfokuskan ulang** mereka kembali bersama (vektor merah tumbuh lagi), memulihkan koherensi yang hilang akibat dephasing statis.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
